  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARSA: Capacity Building Program for Reintegration and Social Protection in Afghanistan, phase III. 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to provide Afghan returnees with individualized and needs-based robust pathways to sustainable reintegration with a focus on economic stability, while also supporting a larger population of vulnerable Afghans both through the capacity building of national institutions. This is done, among other things, through access to individualized services that meet their psychosocial, economic, and social needs, and national stakeholders having improved capacities to deliver social protection and economic development programming.</narrative>
  </description>
